                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Today is the third anniversary of the Inflation Reduction Act, which lowered health care premiums by thousands of dollars, limited prescription drugs prices and out of pocket costs, and unleashed the most oil, gas, and clean energy production in U.S. history.\n\nThe IRA was a win for America, and I will proudly continue pushing to improve health care and secure our energy independence.",
