                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "Letting health insurance premiums jump an average of $180 per month next year will blow up family budgets. Some will even lose their insurance entirely. That\u2019s a nonstarter for me.\n\nI\u2019m an original cosponsor of the Bipartisan Premium Tax Credit Extension Act to make health care more affordable, keep families healthy, and give Mainers a little more peace of mind.",
